                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-location-dot"></i></div><h3>Local SEO + Google Business Profile</h3><p>Every hub city gets a fully optimised Google Business Profile with real reviews, service-area coverage, and category-specific service listings. This is the single highest-ROI channel for local courier companies.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fab fa-google"></i></div><h3>Google Search Ads</h3><p>High-intent capture on courier + service + city queries ("courier service in Andheri", "same-day delivery Bengaluru", "D2C courier India"). Rs 60-200 CPL for local, Rs 350-800 for D2C 3PL-adjacent.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fab fa-meta"></i></div><h3>Meta Ads (Facebook + Instagram)</h3><p>Advantage+ Shopping + custom audiences of Shopify + WooCommerce founders. Click-to-WhatsApp for lead capture at 30-40% lower CPL than form-fill.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i></div><h3>WhatsApp Marketing</h3><p>Booking flows, tracking notifications, rate broadcasts, cross-sell (COD upgrade, insurance, cold-chain), reactivation of dormant senders. WhatsApp Cloud API + Interakt / AiSensy.</p></div>
