                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-star"></i></div><h3>Reviews + Reputation</h3><p>Automated review generation loop via WhatsApp booking confirmation + Google Business Profile response management. Reviews are the compound trust asset in local courier.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-truck-fast"></i></div><h3>Franchise + Partner Marketing</h3><p>For franchise networks + hub-and-spoke partners, we build partner onboarding funnels, franchise-lead pages, and partner-portal content. Multi-region SEO covered.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-newspaper"></i></div><h3>Content + Comparison Guides</h3><p>Rate + comparison + selection guides that D2C founders and small business owners share ("Delhivery vs Blue Dart vs your service for D2C surface shipments").</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-bullseye"></i></div><h3>Lead-Gen Funnels</h3><p>Landing page + form + WhatsApp + CRM + follow-up wired to HubSpot / Zoho. Franchise-partner enquiries + D2C-brand + individual-sender funnels separated cleanly.</p></div>
